PRIVATE REFLECTION: {Round 0 shows clear split: A (Colleagues 1,4,7,12,15,17), D (3,10,16,9), E (2,6,8,11,14,18), with outliers B/C. Core NI 45-106 tests (Jan 2021): individuals (income >200k solo/>300k joint prior 2 yrs + expectation; net fin assets >1M; net assets >=5M solo/joint); entities (net assets >=5M on latest FS OR all owners/interestholders are themselves AIs, including GP/LP and direct/indirect). 

Key evidence/claims preserved: A fails because LP has no own >=5M net assets shown + GP holding co (2538901 Ontario Inc) receives only gifts (6M total) without proven FS net assets or AI status; B/C/D/E each hit at least one test (B: joint income 320k/350k; C: exactly 5M net assets; D: ~10M cash to corp meets entity test; E: 5.2M net from GIC-liab). Counter-claims: D fails if 1% James (285k joint) blocks "all owners AIs" and no independent 5M shown; E fails if Alex/Bob not AIs + properties value unknown so no clear 5M. 

Disagreements: strict "all owners" pass-through for LPs vs corps; whether gifts/FS timing qualify GP; exact 5M threshold wording ("at least"). No errors corrected yet; unresolved: precise GP treatment and E property valuation. Current lean: A is strongest non-qualifier (no entity test met, GP status unproven).}

